| Run2: runs both tests, keeping a copy of the output in Result.
| (Started by !Run in a task window.)
| The render test reads the fonts shipped in the app, with a font cache
| in the scrap directory. FONTCONFIG_FILE is a global variable, so it is
| unset again afterwards (other fontconfig programs must not see it).
CDir <Wimp$ScrapDir>.GTKTest
Set FONTCONFIG_FILE /<GTKTest$Dir>/fonts/fonts.conf
<GTKTest$Dir>.glibtest { > <GTKTest$Dir>.Result }
<GTKTest$Dir>.rendertest /<GTKTest$Dir> { >> <GTKTest$Dir>.Result }
Unset FONTCONFIG_FILE
Type <GTKTest$Dir>.Result
